It depends on with whom one wishes to communicate. If with the loud,
obnoxious posters, maybe sinking to their level will work. Most likely not,
though, because such posters can't seem to hear contrary opinions, whether
expressed politely or obnoxiously, and are particularly resistant to
evidence that triggers cognitive dissonance.

