From caf-talk Caf Jul 30 13:17:31 1993
Newsgroups: rec.arts.books,aus.general,news.admin.policy,aus.politics
Subject:  Re: FREEDOM OF EXPRESSION ON INTERNET - SOME PEOPLE DON'T LIKE IT
